                "startLine": 137,
                "startChar": 0,
                "endLine": 138,
                "endChar": 0
              },
              "replacement": "4. Clicking a ? opens a window that displays the statistical analysis of the performance change, and tools for investigating the change further. There will be a lot of information in this window, such as the Least Squares Error (to show the confidence in whether this is not noise) and step size. You will also see the exact CL again with its CL ID. You can visit the CL by clicking the underlined linked number (the underlined 79169 in this example). This can help you investigate whether the CL actually might have caused the issue or, in the case of rolls, dig deeper in which CL it might have been.\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
